Welcome to the simple and automated installation repository for OptiscalerClient on Windows PC. If you love PC gaming and want an easy, lightweight desktop application to automatically manage, view, and organize your display scaling preferences, image sharpening levels, and frame rate optimization configurations in one place, this standalone tool is exactly what you need.
