Key Features:
Graphics Scaling Dashboard: Easily view, toggle, and structure your custom graphics profiles from a clean, unified interface.
Ultra-Lightweight: Uses very little RAM and CPU resources, ensuring your computer stays completely fast while running games in the background.
Visual Enhancer: Quickly check and configure independent image sharpener filters and texture rendering priorities with standard sliders.
Safe & Clean: Built strictly using standard display configuration protocols and local file management, making it reliable for everyday gaming use.

